<title>UK: Croda says H1 in line with last year.</title>
<headline>Croda says H1 in line with last year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's speciality chemicals firm Croda International said on Wednesday its profits for the first half of the current financial year were expected to be in line with the first half in the previous year, despite the strength of the sterling.</p>
<p>The company said its chemicals operations continued to show strong demand.</p>
<p>The company's share price closed at 271 1/2 pence on Tuesday.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
